WEBVTT

00:03:58.943 --> 00:04:01.487
is to look internally

00:04:01.529 --> 00:04:06.575
and identify unconscious bias
of our people around those disabilities.

00:04:07.410 --> 00:04:12.540
From there, validate
and address their fears,

00:04:12.581 --> 00:04:16.502
and work with your people
to cocreate a solution --

00:04:16.502 --> 00:04:18.629
an inclusive solution --

00:04:18.671 --> 00:04:19.797
together.

00:04:20.631 --> 00:04:24.218
This is how we can build and sustain

00:04:25.386 --> 00:04:28.848
a safe space that nurtures healing

00:04:29.724 --> 00:04:31.017
and disclosure.